{260}{}{The only solution is to build a hydroponics farm in the area known as the Scum Pits. The big problem there is that the Scum Pits are filled with all kinds of critters. Big, nasty, glowing ones that'd sooner eat you than look at you. Dodge tried sending some men to deal with them, but... it didn't end well. And at this point, he refuses to send any more of his men.}
{261}{}{It sounds like you could use some help.}

