{620}{}{What happened? The Brotherhood, that's what happened. The war, my friend. [He points up towards the top of the river canyon above your heads.] They were shelling the South Gate, and some grenades hit my farm. It caught fire, and all my brahmin were killed in the blast. I lost hearing in my left ear. I've temporarily relocated to a house near Downtown Engineering. It's a nightmare, but I'm grateful to still be breathing. [Tears well up in his eyes, rendering him unable to continue speaking about it.]}
